  "summary": "<p>Last year, President Donald J. Trump designated Antifa a domestic terrorist organization and directed the full power of the federal government to hunt down, disrupt, and dismantle the violent anarchist network. This week, the Department of Justice struck another decisive blow by charging 15 Antifa-linked terrorists in a conspiracy to violently obstruct lawful immigration enforcement [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/06/trump-administration-delivers-another-crushing-blow-to-antifa-terrorist-network/\">Trump Administration Delivers Another Crushing Blow to Antifa Terrorist Network</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
